# llm89

A minimal, strict-C89-clean LLM protocol client library for OpenAI-compatible
Chat Completions endpoints over libcurl, including SSE streaming.

- ISO C89, warning-clean under the green profile (C89∩C23, GCC and Clang).
- Transport entirely through libcurl (TLS verification left enabled).
- JSON parse and build through the sibling `libj89` project (no cJSON).
  `libj89` delegates Unicode facts to `libu89`, which is linked in turn
  (`just deps` builds it).
- No CLI, no agent loop, no retry policy, no provider-specific adapters.

See `spec.md` for the full V0 specification.

## Layout

- `include/` — public header `llm89.h` (no curl/libj89 types exposed)
- `src/` — `llm89.c` (API + libcurl), `llm89_sse.c/.h`, `llm89_buf.c/.h`
- `tests/` — SSE/JSON unit tests + protocol tests against a local server
- `.agent/` — concept, design, stories, scenarios, acceptance

## Recipes

- `just build` — compile library sources under strict C89
- `just test` — run unit + protocol tests
- `just test_protocol` — build the protocol test executable
- `just check` — cbaseline + lint gates
- `just lint` — shellcheck + clang-format
- `just asan` — full suite under AddressSanitizer
